window.products.push({"id":399056,"name":"Hudson's Bay Company Stripes Iconic Ice 8 Point Blanket 100% Wool King Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":712.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZtUVh0m-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Woolrich offers hudson's bay point blankets under the official license of the historic hudson's bay company. Our hudson's bay point blankets retain the authentic 100-percent wool quality that has made these blankets legendary. Like those sold in the 18th century, today's blankets are made in england with wool blended from sources in england, wales, new zealand, and india. Each type of wool is selected for qualities that help create a water-resistant, soft, warm, and strong final product. The wool is dyed before it is spun and then air- and sun-dried to brighten the colors. This blanket warms the interior of any home. It will keep you and your guests warm on the coldest nights, just as they've kept generations of trappers, hunters, fur traders, and native americans warm and comfortable. 100-percent wool. Imported. Dry clean. King size 100-inch by 108-inch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZtUVh0m-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hudson's Bay Company","source_asin":"B07SVGK5HK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SVGK5HK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SVGK5HK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
