window.products.push({"id":399082,"name":"Brooklyn Bedding Bloom 14-Inch Talalay Latex Hybrid Mattress with Organic Cotton Cover, Twin XL Soft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WSFnqt4qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The most brilliant sleep solution is derived from nature-the culmination of superior pressure point relief and unique buoyancy found only in Oeko-Tek class 1 certifed Talalay latex. Combining a premium Eurotop, constructed of Joma Wool and organic cotton, with a dense layer of Talalay comfort latex and up to 1,189 individually encased coils, the Bloom Hybrid offers seven times more breathability than other latex beds... plus superior motion isolation and support. The inherently hypoallergenic properties of latex make the Bloom Hybrid a healthier, cleaner, more rejuvenating sleep (top to bottom).  The Bloom Hybrid mattress is engineered using a 3\" top layer of Talalay latex that delivers a unique buoyant quality that relaxes muscles and relieves tensions. Made from natural Talalay rubber and is certified Oeko-Tex class 1. An 8\" base of up to 1,189 individually encased Quantum Edge coils delivers ultimate pressure point relief while decreasing motion transfer. Finally, a 1\" high density foam base adds durability to the mattress while reinforcing individually encased coils as they compress. Mattress comes compressed and rolled in a box for easy parcel delivery to your home. Please note that after unpacking your mattress, allow up to 24 hours for your mattress to expand and any potential odors to fully dissipate. The Bloom Hybrid by Brooklyn Bedding is custom made in our USA factory, using the highest quality materials. Our personal approach to designing, stitching and crafting is back by a 10-year, no hassle warranty. Brooklyn Bedding owns the manufacturing process from start to finish, designing and engineering mattresses in our wholly owned state-of-the-art factory.  Certi-PUR US Certified, which means that our mattress is made without ozone depleters, PBDEs, TDCPP or TCEP (\"Tris\") flame retardants, mercury, lead, heavy metals, formaldehyde or phthalates regulated by the Consumer Product Safety Commission.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WSFnqt4qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brooklyn Bedding","source_asin":"B07J1YPZWL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J1YPZWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J1YPZWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
