window.products.push({"id":399249,"name":"PATIFUN Apple Slicer Corer and Divider 12 Sharp Blades Stainless Steel Apple Cutter Pitter, Thoroughly-Cut Blade Design, Divider for Up to 4 Inches Ap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612uZDU5BML._AC_SL1444_.jpg","description":"★Product Features ★Large diameter: 4-inch cutting diameter, suitable for a variety of fruits and vegetables. ★Multiple blades: 12 blades can cut fruit into 12 equal portions and core them. ★All metal: Made of 304 stainless steel, all metal grip and sharp blade. ★With the Apple Cutter, you can entertain and satisfy them in just 10 seconds, whether it is a friend who visits by accident or a child who suddenly wants to eat fruit! ★Usage Method ★Select an apple no more than 4 inches in diameter, aim at the core, then push the slicer down until the core penetrates to the bottom, then rotate slightly to remove the core. After use, just rinse with water and wipe with cloth. ★Tips for sellers ★Cleaning and drying after use can not only increase the service life of the apple cutter, but also prevent the fruit or vegetable residues from breeding bacteria. ★If the blade is deformed during use, please stop using it to avoid accidents. Useful Information: Size: 6.7x 3.54IN Blade size: suitable for fruit without hard cores below 4IN Color: silver Weight: 10.6 ounces Material: 304 stainless steel blade + zinc alloy handle How to use? Step 1. Align apple to the center of apple slicer corer. Step 2. Press down hard evenly with both hands Step 3. Easily complete 12 equal portions of fruit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612uZDU5BML._AC_SL1444_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B34X9B2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B34X9B2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B34X9B2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
