window.products.push({"id":399266,"name":"Twenty Pearls by Shahidah & WAK (20x8 inches - Framed Art Print - Gold Frame)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OlfPdpQsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An open edition work of art by Kevin \"WAK\" Williams depicting a proud member of this illustrious sorority standing atop a pedestal and giving a hand sign of importance to the organization. At the base of the pedestal, ivy grows and covers the steps.The sentiments on the art print read:Twenty Pearls AKA a pearl indeed... Doing good works, and planting good seeds. Being a star on life's grand stage... Taking the role that I must play, Starring as a AKA. This work of art ships framed and ready to hang in a 2 inch frame with glass front. Artist Bio: WAK is an artist on a mission, but his is no solo trip: He wants to take you on the journey, too. His destination is a place where more African-Americans will appreciate, own and even create fine art that honors their rich heritage and hope filled destiny. So far, tens of thousands of people have willingly followed Williams to that vista – including talk-show host Oprah Winfrey, and actor comedian Bernie Mac. From celebrity homes to small businesses, corporate offices and women’s spas, Williams’ original and lithograph artwork hangs from coast to coast. In fact, his collection of 50 lithograph prints – created under the “WAK Artistry” signature – is the most widely circulated urban fine arts series in the nation. Diverse in their themes, the art is painted by Williams in mixed mediums, and then produced as lithographs in various limited – and broad – edition quantities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OlfPdpQsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Art Depot","source_asin":"B07XCS8RDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XCS8RDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XCS8RDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
