window.products.push({"id":399362,"name":"Victoria 10-Inch Cast-Iron Comal Pizza Pan with 2 Side Handles, Preseasoned with Flaxseed Oil, Made in Colombia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VAB+O7UEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your cooking the upgrade it deserves with high-quality cast-iron cookware. Our Cast-Iron Comal Pizza Pan with 2 Side Handles is superior to traditional comal, griddle, and pizza pans because it offers better quality and can last for years of use. This 10-inch griddle is built from high-quality iron and with the cook in mind. The textured engineered surface maintains the seasoning better than smoothed pans, and the pan has better heat retention and distribution that keeps food hot. This flat griddle pan also features 2 easy-grip loop handles for added stability when you’re cooking, serving, or moving food to your table.Our single flat pan comes preseasoned with 100% non-GMO, kosher-certified flaxseed oil and features a smoother textured skin for easier glide and release for effortless cooking. With a few easy steps, it will stay in great shape and will be ready to create perfect and delicious bread loaves, pancakes, pizzas, crepes, and so much more!Victoria’s versatile cast-iron pizza pan is free of PTFE and PFOA. Use it over an open fire on your next camping trip, on an electric or gas stove top, on the grill at your next BBQ, or in the oven for baking. You can even take it right from the oven to the table. Invest in pans, skillets, and products that will last a lifetime and deliver reliable natural cooking with every meal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VAB+O7UEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victoria","source_asin":"B0B8MN2WKH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8MN2WKH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8MN2WKH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
