window.products.push({"id":399383,"name":"Encasa Homes Floor Cushion Large Square (24\"x24\"x4\") for Casual Seating & Pranayama Meditation Yoga - Buffalo Beige Checks - Padded Decorative Micro-F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1W4rHwi3QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE SIZE: Large 20 x 20 inches with 4 inch height Floor Seats, well filled with fresh micro-fiber, and finished with multiple tucks to keep the shape and bounce. Perfect size for an individual to sit cross-legged. Specially developed in perfect size, thickness, density to give maximum comfort while practicing Meditation, Pranayama, Zafu Yoga. Can be used in front of TV, for playing group games, in garden, etc. MANY DESIGNS & COLORS: Available in several Stripe & Check Designs & Colors to choose from. Easily mix and match your curtains bedlinen upholstery & furnishing to accent every room. FABRIC: Beautiful, rich eco-cotton homespun linen look fabric woven in Vibrant colors. Soft finished cloth and of perfect weight for a luxurious Floor Cushion. Absorbent and breathable fabric prevents sweating. FILLING: Good quality Virgin Polyester Bouncy Fiber filled cushions just enough filling to give firm feel without being too hard. The 9 tucks gives firmness and shape retention. Non-tucked ones tend to move and disturb concentration. WASHING: Best way to clean is to wipe with a wet cloth, so water does not go into the fiber. Dry under fan, not in sunlight. Or hand wash in cold water. Colours will not run, but advisable to wash dark colours separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1W4rHwi3QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Encasa","source_asin":"B08GC1WBKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GC1WBKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GC1WBKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
