window.products.push({"id":399662,"name":"Cathay Home Fashions Luxury Silky Soft Berries Flock Microfiber Queen Sheet Set, Brick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tDp66pQuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxury Flocked Berry Design Microfiber Queen Sheet Set is silky soft for comfortable sleeping. The queen set comes with a fitted sheet with 14-inch drop, 1 flat sheet and 2 pillow cases. The fabric is wrinkle free; colors are rich tones with black flocking. Easy care: Machine wash in cold water on gentle cycle; tumble dry on low; please do not bleach. 100-Percent Microfiber construction. Brick","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tDp66pQuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cathay Home Fashions","source_asin":"B00524UXVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00524UXVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00524UXVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":399663,"name":"Prosixtoy Lumbar Support Pillow for Office Chair, Inflatable Back Support Pillow, Back Cushion for Pain Relief, Ear Piercing Pillow for Side Sleepers,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jTXDnx7HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Multifunctional Pillow] - If you spend a lot of time sitting or driving on chair or desk, this multifunctional pillow perfectly fulfills your needs, being a backrest and also a nap pillow. Back support pillows can effectively relieve fatigue and back pain, support you to achieve a healthy posture and helps maintain the natural curve of the spine. A warm and practical gift for car drivers, teachers, students, office workers. [Lumbar Support Pillow] - With unique ergonomic design, our back support pillow corrects the posture along the natural arch of the waist, follows the curve of your body, for a comfortable hold that fits and feels natural, relieving lower back pain and encourage blood circulation. Unlike other normal back cushion pillows, the hollow design of lumbar cushion pillow keep your back cool and comfortable for the best experience. Ideal for libraries, offices, truck drivers, gaming chairs, long trips. [Inflatable Lumbar Support Pillow] - After pressing the lock button on the side, press the hemisphere about 30 times to fill the air. The times of pressing can be adjusted according to your needs. Press the unlock button and squeeze the pillow to deflate. After deflation, the back pillow is easy to store and carry in your luggage without take too much space. Measures after inflation: 14”(37cm)*10”(25cm)*8”(21cm). Measures before inflation: 8”(20cm)*5”(13cm)*5”(12cm) [Nap Pillow] - the center hollow and arm hole design give you free breathing, natural ventilation. You can adjust the sleeping position: sleep on your stomach, sleep on your back or sleep on your side. This donut pillow will relieve hand numbness, neck pain, ear pain(also as an ear piercing pillow) and shoulder pain. This desk nap pillow is suitable for office workers and students, who need a break to improve efficiency. [Detachable & Washable Cover] - the cover of chair back support pillow is made of the highest quality durable soft fabric, which is detachable and washable. With a hidden zipper in the hollow section for easy removal. If your back cushion pillow has any product defect, please feel free to contact us and return the product for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jTXDnx7HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prosixtoy","source_asin":"B0BLTWNJJ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLTWNJJ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLTWNJJ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":399664,"name":"AAtter Rainbow Shower Curtain Colorful Kawaii Kids Girls Girl Sky Colors Bright Neon Cute Children Child Cloud Galaxy Space Teen Unicorn Funny Dot Pri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qeD3HTjvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"☻ MODERN BATHROOM DECOR ☻ This rainbow shower curtain is creative and unique. It makes the ambience more comfortable with the colorful background. ☻ WATERPROOF SHOWER CURTAIN ☻ This kawaii bath curtain use 100% premium polyester with strong ability of waterproof. ☻ INSTALLATION AND USE ☻ Easy to install and care: can be installed with plastic hooks easily.100% premium Clear Image, No Fading. 100% machine washable. ☻ PRODUCT STANDARD ☻ This girls kids shower curtain measures 60''width x 72''length. Come with 12 strong plastic shower hooks. ☻ GIFT ☻ Housewarming gift for friends.Gifts between friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qeD3HTjvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AAtter","source_asin":"B0C5HYZGQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5HYZGQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5HYZGQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":399665,"name":"One (1) MARA STONEWARE COLLECTION - 12 Ounce Coffee or Tea Cup Collectible Square Bottom Mug - Dragonfly/Insects Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TRKPcWihL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Mara, an accomplished painter, sculptor and ceramicist, studied engraving with the famous artist Alfredo Zalce. After studying art in London, she began working with high-temperature ceramics and created wonderful unique glazes for her pieces. She then went to study with Italian ceramist, Bruno Terese in Italy. Mara has had many expositions of her original pieces in Europe, the United States and Mexico.She developed a fine sensibility in schematic and precise line drawings. Ceramics is no easy medium for precise line drawings, yet Mara mastered her technique with brush and stylus and has been able to portray her life experiences with unrivaled naturalness. We see her universe on parade in all of her work. Flowers, birds and geometric designs all represent her personal vision and display her unique perceptions of the world.After a long illness, Mara passed away in 2007. Since Ceramica Mara has always been an extended family operation, production of her fine work has continued. Mara's husband, children and loyal apprentices have consistently carried out day to day production. Her husband Mariano, an architect, artist and Ceramica Mara business manager, is passionate about continuing Mara's legacy. Her daughter Alexandra, artist and history professor, also stepped in to help the family make a seamless transition in the continuation of the fine production of Ceramica Mara.Mara was a very prolific artist and while her current designs are still in production, she has left numerous yet un-introduced designs to be presented in the future. Alexandra, carrying on her mother's fine tradition, has also been creating ceramic designs which we were honored to debut and continue to offer. Mara brought all the beauty of her soul to walk this earth. We are ever grateful for her creative gifts and pray that her journey continues in beauty and love. We take great pleasure in knowing that Mara's artistic ware’s will grace all of our lives for many years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TRKPcWihL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Structures","source_asin":"B0078HTGM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0078HTGM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0078HTGM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
