window.products.push({"id":399702,"name":"Global Ni 6-Piece Knife Block Set GN-6001, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-J0pObxPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Built to handle the rigors of everyday use, this six-piece set contains five essential knives perfect for a wide range of kitchen tasks, whether it's peeling a batch of apples for a fresh pie or dicing vegetables for soup. Designed by the legendary blade smiths at Global and only available at Sur La Table, the handcrafted Ni cutlery collection offers the cutting-edge performance and precision craftsmanship for which Global is famous-all with a new, innovative design that's engineered to feel like an extension of the hand. Set includes:3.5\" paring knife. 4.5\" utility knife. 6\" chef's knife. 8\" chef's knife. 9.25\" bread knife block (6\" x 8.5\" x 9\") . FEATURES New blade geometry designed exclusively for Sur La Table balances graceful, modern design with precision and durability for the ultimate in performance at the cutting board. Forged from a single piece of stainless steel for the ultimate in strength, durability and performance. Lightweight G18 CROMOVA steel takes and holds a lasting edge-even at the ultra-sharp 12.5A Degree angle used in Japanese cutlery. Rounded spine ensures comfort while using a professional pinch grip. Sleek, ergonomic handles are designed to maximize comfort and control and are precisely weighted for impeccable balance. Seamless design is hygienic and easy to maintain. Manufacturer: Global. Material: Stainless steel, plastic. Care: Hand wash only. Warranty: Lifetime warranty. Made in Japan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-J0pObxPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Global","source_asin":"B00YNU7HYA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YNU7HYA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YNU7HYA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
