window.products.push({"id":399789,"name":"Walfos Silicone Basting Pastry Brush, Small Heat Resistant Pastry Brush, Perfect for BBQ Grill Baking Kitchen Cooking, Strong Steel Core and One-Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mYAMPHJ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ ONE-PIECE DESIGN ＆ STAINLESS STEEL CORE TECHNOLOGY - Owing to ONE-PIECE design, the silicone bristles will not break or shed in your food, unlike other bristle brushes. No bacteria will be stuck in the silicone basting brush and keep your food safe. Handle built with solid internal stainless steel core that increase its durability, continue to perform day after day. ★ PREMIUM SILICONE, HEAT RESISTANT UP TO 450°F - WALFOS pastry brush made of high-quality food grade silicone which is BPA free. Safe to use in Oven, Microwave, Dishwasher & Freezer. Will never melt,discolor or shrink when grilling, basting or cooking (unlike some plastic, nylon or wooden brushes). ★ MULTI FUNCTIONAL FLEXIBILITY - The silicone basting brushes are able to hold good amount of liquids and spread evenly.And quickly takes in thinner sauces that standard oil brushes won’t. Works great for Carolina and Texas-Style BBQ or vinegar-based sauces. Works great on grilling, roasting, baking, meats, pastries, cakes and more! ★ EASY TO CLEAN AND DISHWASHER SAFE - You can easily clean the rubber silicone brush by your hand or put it into dishwasher and then would come out like new. Dry fast and no odor nor residue left after cleaning.The silicone pastry brush also dry fast and no odor nor residue leaves in there! Even leave the cooking brushes aside for a long time, it still stays good. ★ 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE – You'll think we have the best food brush and service on the market. If you have the slightest problem with our product,please feel free to give us a message and we will send you a new one right away without any cost on your side or full money back. We go out of our way to make sure every customer is happy and satisfied with our product and service.Order now, safe and secure, with Amazon Prime!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mYAMPHJ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walfos","source_asin":"B0B7NHZNLF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399789","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7NHZNLF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7NHZNLF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
