window.products.push({"id":399905,"name":"ANVEVO 12\" x 7.25\" Metal American Flag – Original Metal Art Wall Décor Gifts for Men – Quality Hanging Signs for Home, Man Cave, Office – Stylish Read","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uvHCfI9+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a Touch of Patriotic Style and Personality to Your Space Looking for badass patriotic decorations? This is exactly what any law office, living room, public service office, workspace, garage or man cave bar is missing. Show your support for the American values! A Much-Needed Dose of American pride! Our American flag wall decor adds a dash of timeless metal class to any home or office. By infusing dyes directly into the aluminum, your flag will look luminescent and vivid, cheering up with designer appeal any wall at home or at work. Tastefully Designed From Genuine Aluminum Every tin panel is handcrafted to the highest quality standards in our workshop (Cadwell, GA) from 100% Recyclable Aluminum and nothing else. Whatever the space, these badass flags will look ace! Waterproof & Scratch Resistant Dye particles are fused directly below the clear, glossy coating, making our metal prints Scratch Resistant, UV Resistant and Waterproof. This buddy doesn’t not rust. Will survive corrosion for many years. Perfectly Sized for Easy Hanging Measuring 12 x 7.25 inches, this lightweight patriotic decoration fits all indoor or outdoor walls, spaces, cabins, rustic farmhouses, country homes or offices. High Resolution Printing The sublimation dye is semi-transparent, allowing light to pass through the image reflecting on the aluminum for an ultra-luminescent finish that will never fade. Makes a Great Novelty Gift Spread sheer joy with a unique Flag Gift For Him, Veterans, Businesses, Father’s day, New dad, Wedding Anniversary Happy Birthday or Housewarming Gift, Holiday Gift for Dad, or New Home Gifts. Anvevo –A Bit Of Stylish, Patriotic Love Goes A Long Way! We’re here to add a modern feel to every home. Enjoy our super stylish, thin YET heavy-duty and affordable metal flags! Discreet. Simple. Elegant. Get creative! Take your decorating ideas to the next level!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uvHCfI9+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANVEVO","source_asin":"B08YLX9H64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YLX9H64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YLX9H64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":399906,"name":"Lenox Holly Damask Runner, 70-Inch, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IR6PXAFKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Holly Damask tablelimens by Lenox offer the elegance and quality you have come to expect from Lenox. Amazon.com A rich pattern that is suited to occasions throughout the winter months, the Lenox Holly Damask linen line makes gorgeous use of tone-on-tone contrasting. Available in a range of rich colors, the fabric features a subtle but distinctive holly damask pattern evenly dispersed across it. Sewn from a cotton-polyester blend, the pieces are warm and tasteful with a very understated shimmer for elegance. They make an ideal backdrop for ivory fine china, gold-banded patterns, or holiday-themed dinnerware. They are also a beautiful way to add winter elegance to untraditional color schemes. Available in placemats, napkins, runners, and tablecloths of numerous shapes, sizes, and colors, the linens are machine-washable and safe in the dryer for easy cleanup. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IR6PXAFKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenox","source_asin":"B0002X4F4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-399906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002X4F4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002X4F4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
